ulty of Science at Aix-Marseille University.\"}, {\"id\": \"s5\", \"text\": \"\\\"His contributions to our research initiatives have been invaluable, and we are proud to have him as part of our academic community.\\\"\"}, {\"id\": \"s6\", \"text\": \"A thorough examination of Gaudart's publication history reveals a pattern of collaboration with Aix-Marseille University researchers, with several co-authored papers published in reputable scientific journals.\"}, {\"id\": \"s7\", \"text\": \"One such study, published in the Journal of Epidemiology and Global Health, lists Gaudart as a corresponding author and acknowledges the support of Aix-Marseille University's Research Center for Epidemiology and Biostatistics.\"}, {\"id\": \"s8\", \"text\": \"Furthermore, university records obtained through a Freedom of Information request confirm Gaudart's employment with Aix-Marseille University, with documentation dating back to 2015.\"}, {\"id\": \"s9\", \"text\": \"\\\"Jean Gaudart's work has had a significant impact on our understanding of epidemiology and public health,\\\" said Dr.\"}, {\"id\": \"s10\", \"text\": \"Marie-Pierre Coppieters, a colleague of Gaudart's at Aix-Marseille University.\"}, {\"id\": \"s11\", \"text\": \"\\\"His expertise has been instrumental in shaping our research agenda, and we are grateful for his continued involvement with our institution.\\\"\"}, {\"id\": \"s12\", \"text\": \"Data analysis reveals that Gaudart's research output has increased significantly since his affiliation with Aix-Marseille University, with a notable surge in citations and collaborations with international researchers.\"}, {\"id\": \"s13\", \"text\": \"In light of these findings, it is clear that Jean Gaudart has indeed worked with Aix-Marseille University, a testament to the institution's commitment to fostering cutting-edge research and academic excellence.\"}, {\"id\": \"s14\", \"text\": \"**Key Facts:**\"}, {\"id\": \"s15\", \"text\": \"* Jean Gaudart has co-authored multiple papers with Aix-Marseille University researchers, published in reputable scientific journals.\"}, {\"id\": \"s16\", \"text\": \"* University records confirm Gaudart's employment with Aix-Marseille University, dating back to 2015.\"}, {\"id\": \"s17\", \"text\": \"* Gaudart's research output has increased significantly since his affiliation with the university, with a notable surge in citations and international collaborations.\"}]}"
